OL,3,GNEWSAPolice accidentally ran over
OL,4,Asubject of 999 call
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice officers accidentally ran over a
OL,7,Fman who they had been dispatched on
OL,8,Fblue lights to help, an inquest heard.
OL,10,FEdward Langstone, 55, was struck by
OL,11,Ffour vehicles, including a marked Essex
OL,12,FPolice car, on an unlit section of the
OL,13,FA120 at Coggeshall on 3 January on the
OL,14,Fmorning after an evening of drinking.
OL,16,FThe police vehicle was travelling
OL,17,F"under emergency conditions" having
OL,18,Freceived reports of a man walking along
OL,19,Fthe road, an inquest in Chelmsford
OL,20,Fheard.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
